stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Collapsed
  Collapsed --> Loading: Open review
  Loading --> Ready: Current detail loads
  Loading --> Refused: Missing, stale, unauthorized or unsupported
  Ready --> Editing: Type changes
  Ready --> Submitting: Choose supported operation
  Editing --> Submitting: Confirm exact content
  Submitting --> Ready: Draft saved and current detail confirmed
  Submitting --> Done: Receipt and exact card readback
  Submitting --> Conflict: Version changed, retain edits
  Submitting --> Refused: Authority or resolved refusal
  Submitting --> Uncertain: Connection or receipt unavailable
  Uncertain --> Submitting: Retry identical request
  Conflict --> Ready: Updated evidence loaded, retain edits
  Done --> Collapsed: Close
  Refused --> Collapsed: Close
  Loading --> Collapsed: Escape or close before detail arrives
  Ready --> Collapsed: Escape or close
  Editing --> Collapsed: Escape or close
